file_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198822577641/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 1801, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1136, "last_played": 1789010196, "avatar": "4efe1e4699f427f3dac9a9bf9d66c9968d91db66"}, "language": "english", "review": "addictive game loop. My only complaint is I want MORE", "timestamp_created": 1776204546, "timestamp_updated": 1776204546, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1769006794", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "223270685", "author": {"steamid": "76561198315826534", "personaname": "GELOSA.Prime", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198315826534/", "num_games_owned": 31, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 3108, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 35, "playtime_at_review": 1396, "last_played": 1791318504, "avatar": "f50f07af4e3f3d2684a11b0a604c5811b999ebe2"}, "language": "english", "review": "game is great need more people and a lobby system and will be great , but its so fun to spend your time chilling ,slaying mosters and level up , i recommend this game \n", "timestamp_created": 1776202405, "timestamp_updated": 1776202405, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1769006794", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "223250689", "author": {"steamid": "76561199846101649", "personaname": "yelsna", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199846101649/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 555, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 555, "last_played": 1775878038, "avatar": "ee07ca1f7bf265b5e47d04bb98e9b5f22c93fc9b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Lort is a good game but not great… yet. I love risk of rain 2 and enter the gungeon and most rouge-like games. This game is like risk but with its own spin. The bosses are fun and the worlds are pretty cool. The items are alright as well. The only problem I have with this game is the difficulty scaling on hard paired with the 2-3 day mechanic. When I play risk/gungeon it’s all about speed and collecting items to become stronger. And with the hard difficulty on it just seems to give the world enemies massive health bars…. Which is okay but if I only get 3 days to collect items to become stronger I’m basically spending most of my time slugging through a camp to get some coin. And by then I have few items going to boss. But maybe that’s the point lol. Would rather see more debuffs on character opposed to major health buff on enemies… but just an opinion. Don’t ever write reviews but I like this game and wanna see where it goes in the future.", "timestamp_created": 1776182477, "timestamp_updated": 1776182477, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1769006794", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "223242944", "author": {"steamid": "76561198175567810", "personaname": "BuzzLighty1", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198175567810/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 1904, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 597, "last_played": 1786703420, "avatar": "3604ac34b47c87e187d151f22aa17e107253ce34"}, "language": "english", "review": "i dont like normal mode", "timestamp_created": 1776174793, "timestamp_updated": 1776174793, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1769006794", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "223221437", "author": {"steamid": "76561198193537542", "personaname": "Cola", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/moosic_man/", "num_games_owned": 146, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 341, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 337, "last_played": 1779039976, "avatar": "e9168e06a0a294a875c78e6de732ae5e0c080f35"}, "language": "english", "review": "After playing a little longer, this game has a pretty wide variation on how you can play each character. With each having its own specialization however, and the builds you can make can go absolutely nuclear but most of the time it feels like a close enough fight between any of the mods you encounter. Enemy variation is good, and each map has its own feel and theme. Don't forget the hilarious bosses. \n\nIts a shame more people don't play this.", "timestamp_created": 1776140156, "timestamp_updated": 1776906981, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "timestamp_dev_responded": 1777405998, "developer_response": "hey thanks for the thoughtful review!", "app_release_date": "1769006794", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "223218666", "author": {"steamid": "76561198036185789", "personaname": "jma2b2", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198036185789/", "num_games_owned": 415, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 945, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 945, "last_played": 1776134887, "avatar": "8b82ebb5a8e33a109de724f576fbff360f8d5542"}, "language": "english", "review": "was having a lot of fun with friends on this game, it felt like a grind to get better at it and we played a bunch of sessions until we finally got to the final boss, then his AOE attacks didn't appear correctly on everyone's screen except for the host, and these AOE attacks also kept people from being able to be revived due to persisting on people's graves. I hope this makes it to the developer so they know how disheartening this is to experience, where what was once a really good skill based game became super disenfranchising. I hope the final boss's persistent AOE gets a change too, so people can get revived and actually have fun with the game. I would totally have recommended it, but now a recommendation hinges on these issues being addressed, most especially the incongruity between player's sessions from the host on those AOE attacks", "timestamp_created": 1776135199, "timestamp_updated": 1776135199, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 18, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.596294403076171875", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1769006794", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 26, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "223214350", "author": {"steamid": "76561198130900316", "personaname": "DroidMcBoyd", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Triksaz/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 905, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 571, "last_played": 1783305171, "avatar": "2fb8cf0dbf4622a181f9404f871ea7c15f218e3a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Yes", "timestamp_created": 1776128321, "timestamp_updated": 1776128321, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": fal