"playtime_at_review": 3511, "last_played": 1790309899, "avatar": "cafa99ff96bdaa42d602e081882096ac666a50d7"}, "language": "english", "review": "Hard mode for the ranged characters feels so unbeatable.  You get a maybe a quarter of the stats which means your damage is low and your Health is super low.  When you have enemies with unlimited range and they lock on with sniper rifles you can't do anything to them because there is bullet sponges forming a wall between the 20 other ranged units which are shotgunning multishots at you.  Not to mention the 2 different enemies which can cause the entire group to be invulnerable, 1 of which is a former boss.  For the melee characters boss fights are 15 min slogs of slowly whittling them down, mostly with ranged weapons because they 2 shot you and so it is better to range everything down.  I have every upgrade maxed out except starting gold, which has so little impact in hard because percentile increase do barely anything when there are barely any stat shrines.  this game desperate needs better balance.", "timestamp_created": 1776057492, "timestamp_updated": 1776057492, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1769006794", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "223149872", "author": {"steamid": "76561198150564705", "personaname": "Zohanidze", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/gldocx/", "num_games_owned": 315, "num_reviews": 59, "playtime_forever": 575, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 316, "last_played": 1776627478, "avatar": "e1b4811cbf1342e950fb9af6d07ad41cd843e1c4"}, "language": "english", "review": "Cool game, I like it, really fun to play with friends, though there are some minor balance bugs. For example, I gathered 4 dodges and 